            "category": "precision",
            "diceNumber": 2,
            "dieSize": "d8",
            "key": "DamageDice",
            "predicate": [
              "first-attack"
            ],
            "selector": "strike-damage"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Hunter's Flurry",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Frequency once per round\n\n---\n\nEffect The slave lord makes two bow Strikes or two melee Strikes, each using a different weapon. These Strikes must target the slave lord's prey. If both Strikes hit, combine their damage for the purpose of resistances and weaknesses.",
